t aren’t useful. Take that money and do something good with it! The store gives you access to random items to supplement what you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared inventory space between your three characters that lets you transfer items between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4de16fb560a01f14d536e781bcb830eb.avif?t=1762568624\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on your own treasure hunt and collect the rarest and most valuable items. Play at your leisure with no time pressure. Save and close then come back to where you were later. The dungeon is deep, and the loot calls to you, it’s time to <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“My boss caught me playing and I was so immersed I forgot what the boss key was. I got fired. Now I’m broke and homeless but it was totally worth it!”</i> – Somebody Somewhere, Probably</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In Just Keep Looting, play as one of three classes in this 3D turn-based RPG. Fight monsters as you progress deeper and deeper into the dungeon in search of more powerful loot! Designed to play windowed in downtime during other games. Delve into the dungeon and Just Keep Looting!", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/97f17533cb949f612cfa400f36570658c7ea1903/header.jpg?t=1762568624", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/3d93c3b557fa7ed3d4e62cc0e166177a2d0cf69b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762568624", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.a